Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 09:00:00 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] dt-bindings: mailbox: apple,mailbox: Add the S8000 A7 IOP
 mailbox

The A9's always-on processor talks to the application processor
through the same A7 IOP mailbox as the A10's. Add its compatible, with
the T8010's as the fallback.

[Orchard: from orchard PR #101, commit a54e2049; drivers/mailbox/0001
 without the reload wording, the entry placed after the T8010's]

Assisted-by: LLM
---
 .../devicetree/bindings/mailbox/apple,mailbox.yaml          | 6 ++++++
 1 file changed, 6 insertions(+)

diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/mailbox/apple,mailbox.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/mailbox/apple,mailbox.yaml
index ba035ff..ea414a8 100644
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/mailbox/apple,mailbox.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/mailbox/apple,mailbox.yaml
@@ -59,6 +59,12 @@ properties:
         items:
           - const: apple,t8010-a7iop-mailbox
 
+      - description:
+          The same A7 IOP mailbox on the A9.
+        items:
+          - const: apple,s8000-a7iop-mailbox
+          - const: apple,t8010-a7iop-mailbox
+
   reg:
     maxItems: 1
 
